  "caveats": [
    "A `pending/` mismatch is not automatically a sweep: a window may legitimately commit a card it was asked to relay. The ruler cannot tell 'relayed on purpose' from 'swept by a bare commit' -- both look identical to a reader, and that indistinguishability IS the dispatched defect.",
    "`--all` walks every ref, so a card renamed and re-added across refs can appear more than once; counts are per (card, adding commit), not per card.",
    "commits_without_c07_signer counts cards whose adding commit has no `by: X@sess` subject at all -- those cannot be attributed by this ruler either way (advisory, not red)."
  ],
  "runtime_mutation": false
}
